{"title":"Dragon Meat","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Young Red Dragon</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"young-red-dragon\" title=\"Young Red Dragon - dropped it in 45 of 264 looted corpses (1/6)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d3b91d3cbc801eda1dc2.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Young Red Dragon</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/6<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"dragon-meat\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/cooking\">Cooking</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Used to make</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><a href=\"#/item/cooked-dragon-meat\">Cooked Dragon Meat</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Cooking 58</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/ember-roast\">Ember Roast</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Cooking 80</span></li></ul>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/c652a1d404ae06dce58c.svg\" alt=\"Dragon Meat\"></div><h3>Dragon Meat</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>1 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      <tr><th>Used in</th><td>2 recipes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/20/2026, 5:23:36 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}